CORE x86-preprocessing
main.cpp
--winx64 --cpp17 --no-body-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ empty stream buffer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
_Fiopen, _get_stream_buffer_pointers and _Lockit are defined in the MSVC
runtime library and had no body: the FILE pointer and the stream buffer
pointers were nondet.
